    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1868\"><em data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1868\">(3rd Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1891\"><em data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1891\">“Nice try. Logged.”</em></p><p data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1929\">Once per Soma Break, when an effect would:</p><ul data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"2034\"><li data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1949\"><p data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1949\">Rewrite memory</p></li><li data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1978\"><p data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1978\">Alter historical meaning</p></li><li data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2000\"><p data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2000\">Retcon an outcome</p></li><li data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2034\"><p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2034\">Falsify an established record</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2052\">You may declare:</p><blockquote data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2078\"><p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2078\"><strong data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2078\">The record stands.</strong></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2209\">The effect may function locally (illusion, altered perception, etc.), but it <strong data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2209\">cannot alter Precedent or long-term consequence.</strong></p><h3 data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2219\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2259\">No Civic Charge required (limited use).</p><h3 data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2273\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2423\">Using Immutable Record against major narrative forces may accelerate <strong data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2370\">Administrative Pressure</strong>, especially if overused to block organic resolution.</p>",
